      "aliases": [],
      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "needs_confirmation",
      "categoryID": 6,
      "benefits": "Oral supplementation has increased blood and cellular glutathione stores and improved some oxidative-stress biomarkers in a small placebo-controlled study. A separate small liposomal study reported similar biomarker changes. These are formulation-specific biochemical findings; they do not establish broad detoxification, disease prevention, anti-aging, or the benefits of intravenous regimens."
    }
